def maximum_segments(n, a, b, c):
    # Calculate the greatest common divisor (GCD)
    def gcd(x, y):
        while(y):
            x, y = y, x % y

    # Calculate the maximum number of segments by dividing n by their GCDs
    return max((n // a), (n // b), (n // c))
```

